ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/73934cbdc09eb7d406a8917a54e67f3d.poster.avif?t=1793437882\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/73934cbdc09eb7d406a8917a54e67f3d.webm?t=1793437882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283970/extras/73934cbdc09eb7d406a8917a54e67f3d.mp4?t=1793437882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cursors</strong>: Includes many cursors and thousands more from Steam Workshop.<br></li><li><strong>Support</strong>: Works with games, apps, and Windows. Fullscreen and multimonitor support.<br></li><li><strong>Size</strong>: Resize new and original cursors.<br></li><li><strong>Effects</strong>: Trails, zoom, inverted colors, cross, halo, glow, and mirror.<br></li><li><strong>Presets</strong>: Quickly apply pre-assigned cursor sets.<br></li><li><strong>Create</strong>: Use the included editor to make basic and animated cursors, then publish to Steam!<br></li><li><strong>Fast</strong>: No bloat. No impact on performance.<br></li><li><strong>Safe</strong>: Anti-cheat safe and whitelisted by major vendors.<br></li><li><strong>QoL</strong>: Lock Cursor to Window, Mouse Sensitivity Toggle<br></li><li><strong>Linux</strong>: Limited support for games running in Proton.<br></li><li><strong>Fun</strong>: Jiggle physics!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Getting Started</h2>Hover a cursor you wish to change and hit <strong>CTRL ALT C</strong> to open the cursor selection menu. Then choose a new cursor, change size, and add effects.<br><strong>PRO TIP:</strong> To change all cursors quickly, choose the special <strong>ALL</strong> cursor first.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anti-cheat Safety</h2>YoloMouse works like other accessibility tools. It does not modify games or provi